<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-IVANISEVIC WINS CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IVANISEVIC WINS CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the Croatian</p>
<p>Indoor men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 4-6 7-6 (10-8).</p>
